@startuml
title SplitSmart payment settlement
actor Payer
participant "Payment use case" as UC
participant "Balance service" as Bal
participant "Payment repository" as Repo
Payer -> UC: record payment
UC -> Bal: calculate current payer-to-recipient outstanding
Bal --> UC: outstanding amount
alt amount exceeds outstanding
  UC --> Payer: actionable rejection
else valid amount
  UC -> Repo: save payment transactionally
  Repo --> UC: committed
  UC -> Bal: project reduced balance
  Bal --> UC: updated balance
  UC --> Payer: success confirmation
end
@enduml
